        {
          "id": "lo-2427-metafile-raster-approximation",
          "classification": "paint",
          "summary": "The engine draws the bitmap the producer embedded in the metafile, scaled into the picture rectangle, instead of replaying the metafile's blits at page resolution.",
          "measured": "The 121 x 81 embedded DIB is scaled into the 89.84 x 59.54 pt rectangle. Counting coloured pixels over the white page at 96 ppi, the engine draws 10,177 against the reference's 10,384, a 2.0 percent difference. The placeholder this document used to get is gone.",
