          "issue": 33
        },
        {
          "id": "lo-2427-metafile-has-no-vector-records",
          "classification": "parse",
          "summary": "This producer's metafile carries no vector drawing records at all: both the WMF and the EMF inside its comment records contain only DIB blits.",
          "measured": "The WMF plays two META_STRETCHDIB records; the 31,932-byte EMF reassembled from four MFCOMMENT records plays two EMR_STRETCHDIBITS records and nothing else. A vector renderer therefore cannot help this document; a DIB decoder can.",
